	)
	(text "Design Notes (Task 51 - ISOLATED_DAQ_4CH):\n- Full galvanic isolation between host domain (VDD/GND) and DAQ domain (VDD_ISO/GND_ISO).\n- REF3033 generates precision 3.3V VREF_3V3 powering AVDD (ADC reference) of all four ADS7042 ADCs.\n- Each ADS7042 has a 100R / 1nF C0G anti-aliasing + charge-kickback filter, local AVDD/DVDD decoupling, and SPI damping.\n- ISO7741 isolates SCLK, CS, MOSI (forward Ch A-C) and MISO (reverse Ch D)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 335.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "dd2567fa-b207-4c61-b168-575268a702f4")
	)
